	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05r0501_swrival_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『なあ　オマエも
プラズマだん　だよな？▼
さっきの　プラズマだんと
なにが　ちがうか　おしえろよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:21:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:13:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『なあ　オマエも
プラズマ団　だよな？▼
さっきの　プラズマ団と
なにが　違うか　教えろよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T05:52:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:14:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けてsage6_02
・1＝ライバル名</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T05:54:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWRIVAL
ライバル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T05:51:46" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:12:49" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05r0501_sage6_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ロット『ただしく　いうなら
もとプラズマだん　だ▼
２ねんまえの　けんを　きっかけに
つみほろぼし　として▼
もちぬしと　はなればなれに　なった
ポケモンの　せわをしている▼
で　おまえは？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T06:51:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:15:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ロット『正しく　いうなら
元プラズマ団　だ▼
２年前の　件を　きっかけに
罪滅ぼし　として▼
持ち主と　離れ離れに　なった
ポケモンの　世話を　している▼
で　おまえは？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T06:52:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:15:53" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けてswrival_02</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T05:54:05" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SAGE6
元プラズマ団・七賢人ロット</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T05:51:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:12:49" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#8080c0</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05r0501_swrival_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>オレは　ヒュウ！
ヒオウギシティの　ヒュウだ！▼
すうねんまえ　オマエら　プラズマだんに
だいじな　ポケモンを　うばわれた▽
なさけない　トレーナー　だよ！▼
なにが　はなればなれ　だ！
そうしたのは　オマエらだろ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T06:52:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:15:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>オレは　ヒュウ！
ヒオウギシティの　ヒュウだ！▼
数年前　オマエら　プラズマ団に
大事な　ポケモンを　奪われた▽
情けない　トレーナー　だよ！▼
なにが　離ればなれ　だ！
そうしたのは　オマエらだろ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T06:52:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:15:44" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・ギザウインで
・続けてsage6_03
・1＝ライバル名</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T05:54:15" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWRIVAL
ライバル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T05:51:47" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:12:49" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05r0501_sage6_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ロット『そうであったか……
それは　まことに　もうしわけない……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
