		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05r0501_sage6_13"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いまも　ゲーチスさまを　したうもの
おのれの　みちを　ゆく　もの……▼
わたしたち　しちけんじんも
いまでは　バラバラです</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T07:11:54" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T06:31:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いまも　ゲーチスさまを　慕う者
己の　道を　往く　者……▼
わたしたち　七賢人も
いまでは　バラバラです</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T07:11:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T06:48:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・ゾロア入手以降、繰り返し</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T06:32:16" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SAGE6
元プラズマ団・七賢人ロット</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T05:51:13" />
