	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05r0701_hakaim1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>Ｎさまが　おもどりを　まっています
Ｎさまは　ポケモンと　はなせます▼
そうすれば　ここにいる
ポケモンたちの　のぞみが　わかります</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T06:42:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:09:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>Ｎさまが　おもどりを　まっています
Ｎさまは　ポケモンと　はなせます▼
そうすれば　ここにいる
ポケモンたちの　のぞみが　わかります</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T06:42:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:09:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:09:13" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>HAKAIM
元プラズマ団♂１</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T05:51:27" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:06:49" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05r0701_hakaim2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>もとの　もちぬしが　みつからない
ポケモンを　せわしてるんだ▼
じこまんぞく　って　わかってるけど
せめてもの　つぐない　だよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T06:45:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:09:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>元の　持ち主が　みつからない
ポケモンを　世話してるんだ▼
自己満足って　わかってるけど
せめてもの　つぐない　だよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T06:45:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:09:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:09:14" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>HAKAIM
元プラズマ団♂２</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T05:51:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:06:49" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05r0701_hakaim3_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>かこは　かえられないが
みらいは　かえられる……！▼
そうおもい　とりあえず　プラズマだんの
かっこうだけ　かえてみました</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T06:44:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:09:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>過去は　変えられないが
未来は　変えられる……！▼
そう思い　とりあえず　プラズマ団の
格好だけ　変えてみました</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T06:44:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:09:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:09:14" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MOUNTAIN
山男＝元プラズマ団</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:06:26" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:06:49" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05r0701_hakaiw_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>この　ミネズミ
あたしに　なついちゃって……▼
だから　どうぐあつかいを　やめて
きちんと　むきあうことに　したのよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:09:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:09:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>この　ミネズミ
あたしに　なついちゃって……▼
だから　道具扱いを　やめて
きちんと　向き合うことに　したのよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:09:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:09:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・ミネズミと隣接して配置</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T06:09:28" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>HAKAIW
元プラズマ団♀</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T05:51:35" />
		</AttributeCell>
